  "title": "Graphs with a forbidden induced tree are chi-bounded",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Say that a family ${\\mathcal F}$ of graphs is $\\chi$-bounded if there exists a function $f: {\\mathbb N} \\rightarrow {\\mathbb N}$ so that every $G \\in {\\mathcal F}$ satisfies $\\chi(G) \\le f (\\omega(G))$.\n\nConjecture For every fixed tree $T$, the family of graphs with no induced subgraph isomorphic to $T$ is $\\chi$-bounded.",
